_Unification/10 - Commissions.md:16:**Pivot Interiors** has a dedicated Commissions BRD that articulates the commission framework as a stand-alone process area. Pivot's framework covers commission-rate structures, eligibility rules, payout timing, multi-rep splits, accelerators and SPIFs, internal cross-division referral compensation (cross-references CRM §3.02 D-3c), and reporting on commission performance. Pivot's BRD reflects its larger sales organization (divisional structure with NBD, Venture, Public, and Construction Solutions per CRM §3.02 D-3b) where compensation design is a more complex and structured operational concern.
