_Unification/10 - Commissions.md:46:### D-1. Commission basis — actual labor cost vs. quoted labor cost vs. markup-driven
_Unification/10 - Commissions.md:68:**Recommendation for the merged company.** Design the merged-company commission rate structure as a leadership-team decision during the merged-company organizational alignment. The rate structure reflects the merged-company sales motion (per CRM §3.02 D-3 two-dimensional hierarchy), incorporates the merged-company division taxonomy (per CRM §3.02 D-3b), and accommodates both KBM's existing rate patterns and Pivot's existing rate patterns. Specific rates are not within the unification document's scope; the framework is.
_Unification/10 - Commissions.md:70:**Decision for the leadership team.** Confirm: merged-company commission rate structure designed during organizational alignment with rates differentiated by role, division (per CRM §3.02 D-3b), and order type. *Recommended default: confirm at session; specific rates determined during organizational alignment.*
