_Unification/working/codex-review-ProjectMgmt.md:12:Major issue: Workfront retention is not Pivot BRD direction. Pivot PM BRD states “NetSuite Orion will replace Workfront” (`_Unification/working/pivot-brds-md/Project_Management.md:129-131`). The draft instead says Pivot retention/replacement is open and defaults to Workfront retention (`_Unification/09 - Project Management.md:57-64`, `144-151`).
_Unification/working/codex-review-ProjectMgmt.md:14:Same conflict with locked Pre-Quote: Pivot “Workfront in use; specified migration to Orion” (`_Unification/05 - Pre-Quote.md:225-236`) and “Workfront-to-Orion transition” (`_Unification/05 - Pre-Quote.md:248`). PM section says retention/sunset transition (`_Unification/09 - Project Management.md:182`), which muddies that locked direction.
