     4	Not ready to lock. Structure is close, but there are source-accuracy and cross-area issues that will propagate: soft cutover is overstated as common ground, Pivot division naming is wrong, CT-6 CRM/HubSpot migration is missing, and divergence citations do not meet the REQ-ID standard.
