353:The Bank Feeds and Electronic Bill Payments Suite Apps automate cash management processes, eliminating manual bank transaction entry and reconciliation. These standard NetSuite apps have been proven across thousands of implementations and provide reliable, secure banking integration.
355:For payroll integration with Paylocity (or alternative HR platform), NetSuite enables CSV import of journal entries, maintaining financial system integration without requiring the payroll system to store financial detail. This approach accommodates the separation between HRIS and ERP while ensuring financial accuracy.
