359:The Google Drive bi-directional integration (subject to the Google Drive vs SharePoint decision) will make file storage accessible directly from NetSuite transactions. Employees can store and retrieve project documents, quotes, and work orders without leaving NetSuite, improving workflow efficiency and document organization.
