820:## <a id="_Toc221888648"></a>3\.08 Location and Warehouse Management
822:3\.08\.01 Your Business Requirements
824:- __REQ\-3\.08\.01: __Configure two locations \(Fremont and La Mirada\), warehouses and sales office combinations
825:- __REQ\-3\.08\.02: __Enable location\-specific inventory tracking and visibility
826:- __REQ\-3\.08\.03: __Support inter\-location transfers for inventory movement__ __
827:- __REQ\-3\.08\.04: __Configure location\-based fulfillment workflows__ __
