921:## <a id="_Toc221888649"></a>3\.09 User Roles & Permissions
923:3\.09\.01 Your Business Requirements
925:- __REQ\-3\.09\.01: __Configure 25\+ customized user roles supporting Pivot organizational structure__ __
926:- __REQ\-3\.09\.02: __Role\-based access controls limiting users to appropriate data and transactions__ __
