1278:3\.12\.01 Your Business Requirements
1280:- __REQ\-1\.12\.01: __SharePoint integration for centralized document management__ __
1282:- __REQ\-1\.12\.03: __Document access directly from NetSuite customer, project, and transaction records__ __
