   559	## 8. GO-LIVE STRATEGY & TRANSITION
   560	
   561	### 8.1 Your Business Requirements
   562	
   563	- **REQ-038**: Execute soft cutover go-live strategy (not hard cutover) (ALIGNS)
   564	  - New business starts in NetSuite on go-live date
