_Unification/working/pivot-brds-md/System_Setup_and_Configuration.md:748:Key features for Pivot include: Multi\-Location Inventory, Projects, Classes, Departments, Custom Segments, Advanced PDF/HTML Templates, Approval Routing, SuiteAnalytics, Bank Feeds, and Orion\-specific furniture features\. Features not required for Phase 1 remain disabled \(Advanced Financials components like Revenue Recognition, Fixed Assets until Phase 2, Multi\-Currency, etc\.This modules are free \)\.
